WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Marcus Webb: The Q1 numbers are eleven percent under plan and the ad market is not coming back this year.

2
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Priya Raghunathan: What are the levers?

3
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Marcus Webb: Headcount is the only one that moves fast enough. I want a hiring freeze across all departments through the end of Q3.

4
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Alexandra Petrova: Including content? We are already short two producers.

5
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:49.000
Marcus Webb: Including content. No new reqs and no backfills without my sign-off.

6
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Jules Rivera: Do we say anything publicly?

7
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Marcus Webb: Not yet. I will tell the leads, and we say nothing wider until we know whether Q3 recovers.
